              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. 头像附带VIP尊贵标识；",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Vcr1Q",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. 平台首页会员专区优先展示、搜索/匹配结果加权靠前曝光；",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XPd6p",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. 解锁会员专区语音介绍、图片视频等深度信息浏览限制；",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "N656wo",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. 套餐附赠对应牵线次数；",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Z8tVP",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. 申请认识次数升级：普通用户每日仅3次免费「申请认识」，会员可提升至7次；每日次数定时刷新，剩余次数不累计叠加，操作时页面会展示当日剩余次数。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bwuUD",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. 无痕浏览：仅会员可在隐私设置开启无痕浏览，消除访客记录；普通用户点击开关会弹窗引导开通会员。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ybeud",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7. 高级筛选匹配：首页筛选区分基础筛选（城市、年龄、学历）与VIP专属高级筛选（收入、MBTI、兴趣、择偶要求），开放MBTI匹配功能。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "D1m7Mg",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4B5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "8. 访客完整查看：可查看「谁看过我」完整详细访客列表。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O2suBM",
              "name": "权益条目",
              "fill": "#4b5563",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "9. 会员专享每日20次免费查看他人资料，免费额度耗尽仅可通过积分兑换浏览次数，浏览上限大幅提升，使用限制更少。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
